// IntroString :
"P2300002242" "The Family's been running these docks so long, I guess I'm used to them. But the Council isn't. I just heard that they've launched an attack on a known Family business, and it doesn't take much imagination to guess what'll happen. The Council will massacre those gangsters. Now, the Fam may not be your favorite group of people, {HeroName}, but I know you don't want to see bloodshed if you can prevent it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Will you stop the Council's attack on the Family?</a>"
// AcceptString :
"P3822436346" "Stop the Council's attack on the Family"
// SendOffString :
"P3483140454" "You're a good one, {HeroName}. Go in there and kick some butt."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3295410402" "Defeat all villains in warehouse"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3912858824" "That battle's still raging between the Council and the Family. Get over there before any more lives are lost!"

