// IntroString :
"P2402766795" "Someone's in big trouble, {HeroName}, and I think you're the only one who can help. Dr. Francois, the robotics engineer, has been kidnapped by the Council! He's on a ship right now, and you've got to stop it before it leaves port. I have no doubt the Council will force Francois to improve their hideous Zenith Mech Men for them. And I have no doubt he could do it. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>You've got to save Dr. Francois!</a> And you only have 1 hour to do it."
