// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2146791299" "I wonder if you'd be willing to help me out with a personal problem, {HeroName}. See, I lost my ring. My wedding ring! Last night at the Mermaid, it just disappeared! I've asked my friend Long Jack to look into the matter; he knows a lot of the less savory folks about town. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Could you go talk to Long Jack?</a> It would mean a lot to me if you could recover my ring. <br><br>This is a shady town, and things could get dicey. I'd recommend bringing along at least a couple of teammates."
// AcceptString :
"P2307279743" "Talk to Long Jack"
// SendOffString :
