// Dialog :
"P1561341192" "Oh, thank you, {HeroName}, thank you! I'm so grateful! I guess you've figured out that there's more to the ring than I told you, huh? All right, all right, I'll tell you the rest. You see, I'm what those people at MAGI call a 'sorceress.' Down here on Striga, people tend to use the word 'witch.' <br><br>Magic's been in my family for a long time. When I married my Stephen, it seemed only natural to weave the power of our love into our wedding bands. <br><br>I hope this doesn't change the way you feel about me, {HeroName}. I'd like you to carry the ring around for a few days, get used to its magic. Maybe then you'll understand me a little better."
// RandomFameString :
"P2248518915" "Did you see {HeroName} lately? What's with that crazy blue flame?"

